# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile in place of a
# root .dockerignore. Allow-list: deny everything, then admit what the build needs.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/web/
!apps/api/package.json
!packages/schemas/

**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
apps/web/.next
apps/web/dist
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*
**/*.vectors.json
apps/web/Dockerfile*
